## Build & Deploy

### Production Build
```bash
npm run build
npm start
```

### Deploy to Vercel
```bash
# Install Vercel CLI
npm i -g vercel

# Deploy
vercel
```

**Environment Variables on Vercel:**
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`: Backend API endpoint

### Deploy to Netlify
```bash
# Build command
npm run build

# Publish directory
.next
```

